[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m To simplify the second term, we multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}{4(\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta)} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}{4}
