[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m = \frac{96\cos\theta + 144i\cos\theta - 96i\sin\theta + 144\sin\theta}{4} = \frac{96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta + i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta)}{4}
