[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m (300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(468\cos\theta + 300\sin\theta + 36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta) = (324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta) + i(468\cos\theta + 276\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m The real part of the expression is \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\). To find the maximum value of this expression, we can use the fact that the maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). So, the maximum value of \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{324^2 + 432^2}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m Let's calculate this value:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m \sqrt{324^2 + 432^2} = \sqrt{104976 + 186624} = \sqrt{291600} = 540
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m So, the largest possible real part of the expression is \(540\).
