[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=418378)[0m Since \(e^{i\theta} = \cos\theta + i\sin\theta\) and \(e^{-i\theta} = \cos\theta - i\sin\theta\), we can substitute these into the expression:
